Source: https://github.com/openai/php2shell-checker
Upstream commit: ffcd3fc82e5b404f2a04a95b2805ca7639d530fa
Retrieved: 2026-10-23

The original checker is preserved in vendor/phpcheck.cjs.
public/checker.js adapts its version classification and conservative header
selection for browser ES modules and Cloudflare Workers, adds structured
report fields, and removes the Node CLI interface. src/worker.js adds the
HTTP service, public-host validation, timeouts and request limiting.

